window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>J. S. Dewes is back with her acclaimed and action packed Divide series (<i>The Last Watch</i>, <i>The Exiled Fleet)</i> where <i>The Expanse </i>meets the Night's Watch.<br><br>This program features multicast narration. <br></b><br>The Sentinels have rallied under the leadership of Adequin Rake, and Cavalon Mercer has uncovered the horrifying genetic solution his grandfather is about to unleash on the unsuspecting outer colonies.<br><br>Both Rake and Cavalon race against time to save the universe once again. They'll need every resource, every ally who might answer the call.<br><br>It might not be enough.<br><br><u>The Divide Series</u><br><i>The Last Watch</i><br><i>The Exiled Fleet</i><br><i>The Relentless Legion</i><br><b><br>A Macmillan Audio production from Tor Books.</b></p>"; 
